=== login --wait --json, waiting (timed out by the capture) :: $ ployz login --wait --json
Open http://localhost:34733/device?user_code=L5XAY4VA and confirm the code L5XAY4VA.
Waiting for approval... 
=== login again while pending --json (resumes the same code) :: $ ployz login --json
{
  "code": "B2M7BBGT",
  "expires_in": 1800,
  "next": "ployz login --wait",
  "status": "pending",
  "url": "http://localhost:34733/device?user_code=B2M7BBGT"
}

